  "limitations": [
    "This is focused development evidence, not independent compiler reconstruction, full conformance, installed promotion or release qualification. Broad language, callable, admission, bootstrap and qualification owners were not run because source semantics and validation rules did not change.",
    "WVIR has no expression source map. The reported declaration line is the containing function location; it is not the precise failing expression location. Module index refers to the admitted source-set order, not a fabricated filesystem path.",
    "The underlying Package-Lock nominal target mapping rejection is diagnosed, not fixed. Source-name reporting is bounded to 1024 UTF-8 bytes per identifier.",
    "The supplied snapshot bundle and product/log files remain in ignored local Artifacts/Work storage. Their exact hashes are recorded here, but this run is not independently reproducible from a fresh checkout until a maintained minimized reproducer is added.",
    "The first diagnostic build called an unavailable general text-quote service and failed the negative probe. The corrected implementation uses validated identifier bytes and the existing text-concat service. The final seven-case runs are the passing evidence.",
    "An oversized file returns the pre-existing hosted-provider exit code 73 with no compiler diagnostic; it never reaches analysis. Truncated accepted-size inputs retain exit code 1 and Invalid-analysis diagnostics.",
    "Peak working-set memory was not measured. Construction uses retained lower-level products and is not a cold bootstrap measurement. The all-function inspection reports a maximum of 1504 parameter/local slots against the unchanged 2048-slot limit."
  ],
